WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.763
The purpose of my program is to have the mouse draw an

2
00:00:03.763 --> 00:00:06.480
octagon, so he gets to eat some cheese.

3
00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:09.950
When the green flag is clicked, the reset block puts him

4
00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:12.755
at his starting spot with his pen down and ready to

5
00:00:12.755 --> 00:00:13.030
draw.

6
00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:16.970
Then he says, if I draw an octagon, I get to eat cheese.

7
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:20.587
My code works by using nested repeats in this part to

8
00:00:20.587 --> 00:00:22.820
draw all eight sides of the octagon.

9
00:00:23.170 --> 00:00:26.342
Each time through, he turns forty five degrees. Then he

10
00:00:26.342 --> 00:00:28.130
says squeak and waits a second.

11
00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:32.142
And it also uses nested repeats in this part to draw one

12
00:00:32.142 --> 00:00:32.470
side.

13
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:36.295
He moves twenty steps and waits half a second, and he

14
00:00:36.295 --> 00:00:37.680
does that four times.

15
00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:41.588
Then the big repeat starts over, so he turns and draws

16
00:00:41.588 --> 00:00:42.510
the next side.

17
00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:48.885
The inner repeat runs four times for every one time the

18
00:00:48.885 --> 00:00:49.970
outer repeat runs.

19
00:01:01.030 --> 00:01:04.369
So that's eight sides with four moves each, which is

20
00:01:04.369 --> 00:01:05.910
thirty two moves in all.

21
00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:19.690
Every side starts with a turn, and that's what makes the

22
00:01:19.690 --> 00:01:20.160
corners.

23
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:27.110
Eight turns of forty five degrees adds up to a full

24
00:01:27.110 --> 00:01:30.160
circle, so he ends up right back where he started.

25
00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:35.415
If I were to change this nested repeat like this, for

26
00:01:35.415 --> 00:01:38.232
example changing the eight to a four, the program would

27
00:01:38.232 --> 00:01:40.998
run differently. He would only make it halfway around,

28
00:01:40.998 --> 00:01:43.867
so he would only draw half of the octagon. So the number

29
00:01:43.867 --> 00:01:45.660
in the outer repeat really matters.

